      "note": "Own training: 56.85% at 8,016 updates;\npaper 56.7%. Start: 39.77%, gain 17.07\npoints. All answers regraded.\n\nIntermediate, not final reproduction. No\nbest checkpoint or causal BOS claim.\n\nFinish fixed 11,040 updates, then final\ntest and regrade. RLM transfer unproven.\n\nNext: historical Dr. GRPO lessons."
